OL,3,ABangkok roads submerged as flood
OL,4,Adisaster declared
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flood emergency disaster has been
OL,7,Fdeclared across Bangkok after 48 hours
OL,8,Fof heavy rain left roads in the Thai
OL,9,Fcapital submerged.
OL,11,FPeople have been urged to stay at home
OL,12,Fand those living close to the city's
OL,13,Fnetwork of canals have been advised to
OL,14,Fmove their belongings to upper floors.
OL,16,FThunderstorms are common in Thailand at
OL,17,Fthis time of year but extreme weather
OL,18,Fin recent days has inundated Bangkok's
OL,19,Fdrainage system, causing traffic chaos
OL,20,Fon roads that are already famously
OL,21,Fcongested.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
